cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "LPDF — LLM-Based Protein Design Framework"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a unified pipeline for designing novel protein
  sequences with large language models, covering conditional generation,
  filtering, two-tier structural validation, novelty assessment and
  multi-objective ranking.
